### • [Absolute position sensor] • [Brushless DC motor] • [Off-axis angle measurement] • [Closed-Loop Stepper Motor] • [Barrier gates]


KTH7816 Series


settings such as the zero-angle position, ABZ encoder configurations, and
magnetic field detection thresholds, allowing for adaptable performance
across various operational environments.


In summary, the KTH7816 Series is engineered to provide versatility, accuracy, and adaptability, making it a reliable solution for a wide range of
angle measurement and control applications.

